      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd be happy to help you with a simple 4-week program. Here's a beginner-friendly program focusing on squats, bench press, and deadlifts with linear progression:\n\n**Weeks 1-2**\n- Monday: Squats (3 sets of 8-12 reps, 70-80% 1RM)\n- Tuesday: Bench Press (3 sets of 8-12 reps, 70-80% 1RM)\n- Thursday: Deadlifts (3 sets of 8-12 reps, 70-80% 1RM)\n- Friday: Rest\n\n**Weeks 3-4**\n- Monday: Squats (3 sets of 6-8 reps, 75-85% 1RM, +10-15lbs/5kg)\n- Tuesday: Bench Press (3 sets of 6-8 reps, 75-85% 1RM, +5-10lbs/2.5kg)\n- Thursday: Deadlifts (3 sets of 6-8 reps, 75-85% 1RM, +10-15lbs/5kg)\n- Friday: Rest\n\n**Additional Tips**\n- Start with lighter weights and focus on",
